                <pb facs="0273" n="201" sameAs="frus:frus1882/pg201"/>

                <head>No. 112.<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Lowell to Mr.
                    Frelinghuysen</hi>.</head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Legation of the United States</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >London</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1882-03-07"><hi rendition="#italic">March</hi> 7,
                        1882</date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>[Mr. Lowell reports that the instructions in Mr. Frelinghuysen’s dispatch of
                    March 4, 1882, have been obeyed, and that Earl Granville has informed him that
                    the matter will have immediate attention.]</p>
            </div>
        </body>
